      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/aspers_pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A 1919 cannery in Aspers later joined the Mott group, helping Adams County lead Pennsylvania’s apple‑processing industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/aspers_pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Aspers sits on South Mountain’s eastern slopes, a rural hub famed for apple production and processing.",
